        "original_id": "9442bf72-e3b2-535a-b34a-bf7d36a3075c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Solemani, Renee Zellweger\n- Products: Him & Her, Bridget Jones's Baby, Bad Education\n- Organizations: BAFTA, Evening Standard, Working Title, BBC Three\n- Places: Walthamstow, London, United Kingdom\n- Topics: television sitcoms, acting, writing, activism\n\nFacts:\n- Him & Her was first broadcast in the United Kingdom on BBC Three on 6 September 2010.\n- Him & Her is a British television sitcom about Steve and Becky, a lazy twenty-something couple who live in Walthamstow, London.\n- Sarah Solemani is an award-winning English actress, writer, and activist.\n- Sarah Solemani is best known for starring in the BAFTA-winning sitcom Him & Her.\n- Sarah Solemani played Miranda, the best friend of Renee Zellweger's character, in Working Title's Bridget Jones's Baby.\n- Sarah Solemani was nominated for an Evening Standard Best Actress Award for Bridget Jones's Baby.\n- Sarah Solemani played Rosie Gulliver in Bad Education.",
